---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';
import Content from '~/components/widgets/Content.astro';
import CallToAction from '~/components/widgets/CallToAction.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'OKELAS Partners',
  description:
    'The OKELAS partner program is for organizations that want to deliver operational knowledge capabilities to their clients. We are currently recruiting design partners -- no official partners yet.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} translationId="about-partners">
  <HeroText
    tagline="Company"
    title="OKELAS Partners"
    subtitle="We are building a partner program -- and are currently recruiting our first design partners."
  />

  <Content
    content={`
      <p>The OKELAS partner program is built for organizations that want to deliver operational knowledge capabilities to their clients, with OKELAS as the underlying platform. This is not a standard software reseller model -- it is a collaboration to create new value.</p>

      <h2>We Are Recruiting Design Partners</h2>

      <p>OKELAS currently has no official partners. We are actively recruiting design partners -- organizations willing to help shape the product, the market, and the partnership model from the earliest stage. This is not a reseller relationship.</p>

      <p>A design partner who fits what we're looking for is an organization that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Serves manufacturing SMEs in Vietnam or the broader Southeast Asia region</li>
        <li>Wants to add process and operational knowledge consulting to its service portfolio</li>
        <li>Is willing to contribute real customer feedback to jointly develop the product</li>
        <li>Wants to build a differentiating capability -- not just represent another software product</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Partnership Model</h2>

      <p>The design partner relationship is not about reselling software. It is a collaboration to jointly build a new capability layer -- in which both parties co-own the outcome and the methodology. Design partners participate in shaping how OKELAS is deployed, packaged, and taken to market.</p>

      <p>If you are an implementation consultant, management consulting firm, or systems integrator looking to create deeper value for your manufacturing clients -- we'd like to talk.</p>
    `}
  />

  <CallToAction
    actions={[
      {
        variant: 'primary',
        text: 'Contact Us',
        href: '/contact',
        icon: 'tabler:mail',
      },
    ]}
  >
    <Fragment slot="title">Interested in Partnering?</Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="subtitle">
      Reach out to start a conversation. We are looking for partners who share the same view on the value of operational knowledge.
    </Fragment>
  </CallToAction>
</Layout>
